<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-W SIGNS DEALS WORTH PLN 4.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-W SIGNS DEALS WORTH PLN 4.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Mostostal Warszawa SA signed two deals worth total 4.6 million zlotys for carrying out metal construction work in Denmark and in Germany, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
